## Batch words

`approve all` or `approve the rest` → state the number of items that would
be approved and ask the user to confirm, end turn. On confirmation,
`todo-triage approve <slug>` per remaining item, relaying each output line
verbatim. No other bulk form exists. A filter the user wants — "all P3" — is
`todo-triage list --review pending --priority 3`, which you run and show;
the user then names the slugs.

